ThisComputer=本机：
;This computer:
ThisEffectIsAccumulatedOnEach=每按一次按钮此效果都会累积，可按“重置”按钮\n重置——但反射也会被一同撤销！
;This effect is accumulated on each button press, you can reset by pressing\nthe 'Reset' button - but reflections would also be undone!
ThisFileAlreadyExistsDoYou=此文件已存在。确定要覆盖吗？
